 forever\" with a ton of paperwork — but everything was sorted out within a week of the accident (by 2023-06-21); he had been worried about the cost, but it \"wasn't too bad\" [S9T3][S9T5].\n- As of 2023-06-21 the car is at an auto repair shop being fixed up — \"can't wait to drive it again\"; shared a photo of a tow truck parked in a parking lot [S9T3].\n- Shared a photo of the mechanic working on the car in a garage; the mechanic \"knows the stuff\" and is doing his best to get the car running again [S9T5][S9T7].\n- As of 2023-06-21, feeling way more confident and excited to show off the car once it's back — he's trusting the repair shop's expertise, thanked Dave for his help, and is excited to drive again [S9T9][S9T11].\n- As of 2023-07-07, the car is fixed and \"going strong\" — \"It's all good now\", and he's stoked to be back on the road (\"Nothing better than cruising around - it's the best!\"); shared a photo of the red sports car parked on the side of the road [S10T2].","text_sha256":"e3d7556d577a1b8e01e1a2fc1dbdec2e7ac42607adc7570ee0125b35c966a28c","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D6:3"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":94,"line_start":94,"source_locators":["[S6T3]"],"text_sha256":"14cc1105415abef3aa0a434f6982ee9319a99d2bffea2fde232e2fd7d80d8010"},{"dia_ids":["D6:3"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":95,"line_start":95,"source_locators":["[S6T3]"],"text_sha256":"addf6d9d1bb03368c5c8643f292bf2b124a7f209c601f4eb028af037bd93c191"},{"dia_ids":["D6:5"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":96,"line_start":96,"source_locators":["[S6T5]"],"text_sha256":"586f3d07f1982fea25dffa03971d162247587b27a915602a62226bbf53d43391"},{"dia_ids":["D6:5"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":97,"line_start":97,"source_locators":["[S6T5]"],"text_sha256":"2e775002b1fc8c32da703612b9d3326399380a6de73422f4bf8c739c53f9c988"},{"dia_ids":["D6:4"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":98,"li